nt with GH replacement.\n- **Body composition**: Hormone replacement combined with progressive resistance training can reverse the catabolic body composition changes.\n- **Bone health**: Initiate calcium (1200 mg/day) and vitamin D (2000 IU/day). Fall prevention program given osteoporosis risk.',
